## 1. Overview
This screen lets Provider-portal users search for existing File Transfer Configurations and open dialogs to create or view a configuration. [shot:0]

Primary tasks:
- Search configurations using criteria (Configuration ID / Name / Owner / Owner Module / Protocol) and show results in a grid. [ctl:text-configuration-id-configuration-i, ctl:ConfigName, ctl:OwnerName, kit:k2, kit:k3, kit:k4]
- Create a new configuration via the “Add File Transfer Configuration” dialog. [ctl:FileTransferGridAddButton, kit:d1]
- View an existing configuration via the “View File Transfer Configuration” dialog. [kit:k4, kit:d2]

